        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "In view of the 164 Cr.P.C. statement of the victim, who is a minor girl reading in Class-X and the nature and gravity of accusation, at this stage, while not inclining to release the petitioner on bail,\nliberty is granted to the petitioner to renew his prayer for bail after examination of the victim in the learned trial Court.",
